   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "LinkedIn just retired its own AI post writer.",
     "start": 0.0,
     "end": 3.38
    },
    {
     "text": "Yes, the button that rewrote your posts for you.",
     "start": 3.7,
     "end": 6.57
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 7.17,
   "end": 13.54,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "The replacement is called Post Proofreader.",
     "start": 7.17,
     "end": 10.32
    },
    {
     "text": "It only suggests edits to words you already wrote.",
     "start": 10.64,
     "end": 13.54
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 14.14,
   "end": 17.83,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Every change shows up tracked, so you approve it first.",
     "start": 14.14,
     "end": 17.83
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 18.43,
   "end": 24.72,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Why now? People reported AI slop more than a million times,",
     "start": 18.43,
     "end": 22.97
    },
    {
     "text": "in under three weeks.",
     "start": 23.29,
     "end": 24.72
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 25.32,
   "end": 30.72,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "So the signal is pretty clear.",
     "start": 25.32,
     "end": 27.4
    },
    {
     "text": "LinkedIn wants your voice, not a generated one.",
     "start": 27.72,
     "end": 30.72
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 31.32,
   "end": 38.49,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "My take: draft it messy, in your own words.",
     "start": 31.32,
     "end": 34.71
    },
    {
     "text": "Then let AI tidy it up, never think for you.",
     "start": 35.03,
     "end": 38.49
    }
   ]
  },
  {
   "start": 39.09,
   "end": 42.239,
   "phrases": [
    {
     "text": "Follow for more AI and marketing news that actually matters.",
